{"data":{"body":"[P2] Contain exceptions from cause classification\n\nAn `Error.cause` can be an object with a throwing `Symbol.toStringTag` getter or a revoked proxy. The `toString.call` or `instanceof` checks then throw outside `toCauseLevel`'s guard, aborting record construction. The SDK swallows the hook rejection, so the final failure record is never exported. Guard classification at both call sites, ending only the cause chain when inspection fails, and add regression tests for these inputs.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABA17nDg","finding_digest":"b78d6e59411876d8ccc70fb04da377ed4fd8d095dc9ae9cf91f81240024fe11a","finding_id":"arf_v1_w6gw4wkbdb3nrtghb6ye3i3x5v","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-telemetry-exporter/src/index.ts::iserrorobject::cause-getter-error-isolation","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-telemetry-exporter/src/index.ts::iserrorobject::cause-getter-error-isolation","line":225,"observation_digest":"27fae5d54a8940be316638d199a9c10652ad95ab6f99fb6eb7b081c0828c813f","observation_id":"aro_v1_e75olvkkrfal4mlghdiztkobaz","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-telemetry-exporter/src/index.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-22T17:35:15Z","review_id":"arr_v1_foezgpdywc5cv2nlhejjuufblp","reviewed_base_sha":"28002d32e65a6577c63cdf3c1b69480347cbe2ea","reviewed_head_sha":"cb5daa367ea587713a7fabea169ea8de3375c3e9","reviewer":"codex","start_line":221,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":1059},"record_id":"art_v1_jfymjmkln7rnsoarwi5chgyy7q","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-22T17:35:15Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
